e Parade to Worli, Lower Parel and Parel. What sets new residential projects in South Mumbai apart from anywhere else in the country is a simple structural fact: there is almost no fresh land left. Nearly every new building project in South Mumbai today is a redevelopment, replacing an older structure with a modern tower on the same footprint, which keeps genuinely new supply permanently scarce against demand from legacy wealth, family offices and NRI buyers.","score":0.6450534,"raw_content":null,"id":"21aafd-05"},{"url":"https://www.magicbricks.com/new-projects-Worli-in-Mumbai","title":"New Projects in Worli, Mumbai - MagicBricks","content":"Find over 19+ new projects in Worli, Mumbai. Now Launched in Dec 2025, Godrej Trilogy Seafront is a newly launched project in Worli, Mumbai. 16.61 Cr - 25.47","score":0.55623144,"raw_content":null,"id":"9fc715-06"},{"url":"https://www.99acres.com/indiabulls-blu-worli-south-mumbai-npxid-r1022","title":"Indiabulls Blu Worli, Mumbai - 99acres.com","content":"Worli, Mumbai has 46 ready to move housing societies. Around 9 projects are under-construction here. There are 8 newly launched projects in Worli, Mumbai.","score":0.5106191,"raw_content":null,"id":"ceb646-07"},{"url":"https://www.squareyards.com/blog/runwal-raaya-worlis-most-anticipated-luxury-project-npart","title":"Runwal Raaya Worli Mumbai | Project & Amenities Details","content":"Runwal Raaya is a luxury residential development rising in Worli, South Mumbai. Spread across 4.2 acres, the project features two iconic towers","score":0.48865002,"raw_content":null,"id":"76ba32-08"},{"url":"https://www.nobroker.in/new-projects-in-worli-mumbai-page-4","title":"Ready to Move in Projects in Worli Mumbai - NoBroker","content":"New Projects in Worli Mumbai | Ready to Move Projects in Worli Mumbai ; Indiabulls Sky Forest. ₹9Cr. Indiabulls Real Estate ; Rustomjee Crown. ₹9.7Cr - ₹47.3Cr.","score":0.39501804,"raw_content":null,"id":"e91075-09"}],"response_time":4.83,"request_id":"85e9d